hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Nahr ke din namaz parhi. Phir khutba diya. Phir zibah kiya. Phir farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle zibah kare wo us ki jagah doosra zibah kare. Aur jo zibah na kare wo Allah ke naam se zibah kare."
"1281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere mamun ne qurbani ki, jinhe Abu Burda kaha jata hai, namaz se pehle. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Tumhari bakri gosht ki bakri hai. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mere paas paltu chhe mah ki bakri hai. Aap ne farmaya: Use zibah karo. Aur wo tumhare siwa kisi ke liye durust nahi hogi. Phir farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle zibah kare wo to apne liye zibah karta hai. Aur jo namaz ke baad zibah kare us ka nusuk poora hua aur us ne Musalmanon ki sunnat payi."
"1282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo namaz se pehle zibah kare wo lautaye. Phir ek shakhs khada hua aur arz kiya: Ye wo din hai jis mein gosht ki khwahish ki jati hai. Aur us ne apne padosiyon ka zikr kiya. Phir goya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki tasdeeq farmayi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur mere paas chhe mah ka bachcha hai jo mujhe gosht ki do bakriyon se zyada mehboob hai. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use ijazat di. Phir main nahi janta ke ijazat us ke siwa ko pahunchi ya nahi."
"1283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhe bakriyan deen taake apne sathiyon par taqseem karein. Phir ek nar bachcha baqi raha. Phir unhon ne is ka Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zikr kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum qurbani karo."
"1284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne do chitkabre seengon wale mendhon ki qurbani ki. Unhe apne hath se zibah kiya. Naam liya aur takbeer kahi. Aur apna paon un ke pehluon par rakha."
"1285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak hum kal dushman se milenge, jabke hamare paas chhuriyan nahi hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Jaldi karo ya dikhao. Jo khoon bahaye aur us par Allah ka naam liya jaye to khayiye. Daant aur nakhun nahi. Aur main tumhe khabar dunga. Raha daant wo haddi hai. Aur raha nakhun wo Habsha ki chhuri hai. Aur hum ne oonton aur bakriyon ka loota hua maal paya. Phir us mein se oont bhaga. Phir ek shakhs ne use teer mara. Phir use rok liya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak in oonton ke wehshi hain jaise wehshi janwaron ke wehshi. Phir tum mein se jo us se maghloob ho us se aisa karo."
"1286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Dhu al-Hulaifa mein they. Phir logon ko bhook lagi. Phir unhon ne oont aur bakriyan payein. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Nabi Karim aakhri logon mein they. Phir unhon ne jaldi ki aur zibah kiya aur handiyan rakhein. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne handiyon ka hukm diya aur wo undel di gayein. Phir taqseem kiya. Phir dus bakriyon ko oont ke barabar farmaya. Phir us mein se oont bhaga. Phir unhon ne use talash kiya aur wo unhe aajiz kar gaya. Aur qaum mein thode ghode they. Phir un mein se ek shakhs ne teer se ishara kiya. Phir Allah ne use rok liya. Phir farmaya: Beshak in janwaron ke wehshi hain jaise wehshi janwaron ke wehshi. Phir tum mein se jo us se maghloob ho us se aisa karo. Main ne arz kiya: Beshak hum kal dushman ki ummeed rakhte hain ya darte hain, jabke chhuriyan nahi hain. To kya hum sarkande se zibah karein? Aap ne farmaya: Jo khoon bahaye aur us par Allah ka naam liya jaye to use khayiye. Daant aur nakhun nahi. Aur main tumhe is ke bare mein khabar dunga. Raha daant wo haddi hai. Aur raha nakhun wo Habsha ki chhuri hai."
"1287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Qurbaniyon mein se teen khayiye. Aur Abdullah Mina se laut-te waqt tel se khate, hadi ke gosht ki wajah se."
"1288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Qurbani, hum us mein se namak lagate. Phir use Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Madina mein late. To Aap ne farmaya: Teen din ke siwa na khayiye. Aur wo lazim nahi thi. Lekin Aap ne irada farmaya ke us mein se khilaye. Allah zyada janta hai."
"1289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum apni oontniyon ke gosht mein se Mina ke teen se upar na khate. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ijazat di. Phir farmaya: Khayiye aur tosha lijiye. Phir hum ne khaya aur tosha liya."
"1290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salama bin al-Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se jo qurbani kare wo teesri ke baad subah na kare jabke us ke ghar mein us mein se kuchh ho. Phir jab agla saal tha to unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Hum karenge jaisa hum ne guzre saal kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Khayiye, khilayiye aur jama kijiye. Kyunke us saal logon mein mehnat thi. Phir main ne irada farmaya ke tum us mein madad karo."
"1291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Fara aur ateera nahi. Aur fara pehla bachcha tha jise wo apne buton ke liye zibah karte they."
